# Secrets — your real keys live here, never commit them.
# Root-anchored: the extension's local key config now lives at
# apps/extension/config.js (legacy PoC-era copies sat at the repo root).
# Nested units (apps/*/lib) version their config modules as code
# (see apps/worker/worker/config.py).
/config.js
/apps/extension/config.js

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store

